### Overview

**RNNoise on this branch treats audio as 16‑bit PCM samples (stored in `short`) and supports two compile‑time sample rates: 48 kHz (default) and 8 kHz.**  
The 8 kHz mode is selected via `RNNOISE_SAMPLE_RATE`, which resizes frames, pitch periods, FFT sizes, and band layout, while the I/O and training paths assume 16‑bit linear PCM.

